  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fairy Jiang Yu tells Chanyu Zhong Er that using this move to battle He Lang Zi and recruit a rank seven as a goon for his tribe is too naive. Chanyu Zhong Er’s expression sinks, because she has spoken accurately.",
