        "char_he_lang_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chanyu Zhong Er yells the name while fleeing He Lang Zi. His body shudders, he puts his palms together, turns around, and makes a chopping motion. Fire rises and gathers to form an axe in midair. Before the attack lands, the scorching flames burn some of the wolf’s fur. The huge fiery axe makes the surrounding sky glow red and carries an aura of destruction. The huge wolf vanishes, evading the immemorial flame axe, after Fairy Jiang Yu teleports him with an immortal movement killer move.",
